{"id":18162246667,"name":"Isekai War Crime Simulator [v0.4.6]","desc":"","path":"/game/18162246667-isekai-war-crime-simulator-v0-4-6","slug":"18162246667-isekai-war-crime-simulator-v0-4-6","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b711d22bd0627310e4912c660e2dbf8b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b9f09f8d001e580c3e0b29069aa8bf18/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-04-13T11:14:01.866Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Isekai-War-Crime-Simulator-v0.4.6-Infinite-Money-and-Infinite-Health-35366","_id":"67fb9c795b1e96ac9ba6ed78","title":"Infinite Money and Infinite Health","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c781d7","gameId":18162246667,"name":"Isekai War Crime Simulator [v0.4.6]","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-b9f09f8d001e580c3e0b29069aa8bf18-230a50f247a3.png","placeId":18162246667},"features":"For infinite money the number you put in givemoney variable will be multiplied by 10000 so 100 will give you 1 million Zonies. Execute as many times as wanted.\n\nReset after executing infinite money a lot of times, you will have a TON of golden snipers in your inventory that cause lag\n\nFor Infinite health: negative numbers will give health while positive will take away health, if you put huge numbers the game will sometimes reset your health back to 100.\n\nTell me if something doesn't work, or you want another script for something else.","tags":["Infinite","GodMode","Money","Infinite Money","Isekai War Crime Simulator"],"script":"--Infinite Money\nlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal hmrp = player.Character.HumanoidRootPart\nlocal loot = workspace.Lootable.L4:FindFirstChild(\"Loot4\")\nlocal givemoney = 100 --edit for money it multiplies by 10000\n\nhmrp.CFrame = CFrame.new(5006, 69, -2271) --remove this part if you die when executing\ntask.wait(1)\nhmrp.CFrame = loot.CFrame + Vector3.new(0,5,0)\ntask.wait(1)\nfor i = 1, givemoney do\n    task.spawn(function()\n        fireproximityprompt(loot.ProximityPrompt)\n    end)\nend\n\n\n\n\n--Infinite Health\nlocal args = {\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {\n            [1] = \"\\16\",\n            [2] = -1000      --edit this for health\n        }\n    }\n}\n\ngame:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"RemoteEvent\"):FireServer(unpack(args))\n","owner":{"_id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d","username":"swagdoge316","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d-1781195287501.jpg","status":"offline","id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d","leaderboard":{"tag":null},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5}},"verified":false,"views":8260,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/18162246667-1744542841808.webp","likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-04-13T11:14:01.867Z","editBy":{"_id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d","username":"swagdoge316","status":"offline","id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d"},"executes":82,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67fb9c795b1e96ac9ba6ed7a","editBy":{"_id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d","username":"swagdoge316","status":"offline","id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-04-13T11:14:01.870Z"},{"_id":"680653e472b1759084f6e921","editBy":{"_id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d","username":"swagdoge316","status":"offline","id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-04-21T14:19:16.671Z"},{"_id":"680655df349aff89e6581f45","editBy":{"_id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d","username":"swagdoge316","status":"offline","id":"67eeb7347dc41710ac40bc2d"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2025-04-21T14:27:43.748Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"68064970a89fd911d92f8652","commentBy":{"_id":"680649418fe2d5b1983e5bb9","username":"Flamup17","verified":false,"ro